Static analysis codebase linter

Usage: omni-code-lint [OPTIONS] [PATHS]...

Arguments:
  [PATHS]...  Paths to inspect [default: .]

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>      Output format for diagnostics (plain, json) [default: plain]
      --diff                 Run linter only on files/lines changed in VCS
      --diff-rev <DIFF_REV>  Run linter comparing against a custom revision/commit (implies --diff)
  -h, --help                 Print help
  -V, --version              Print version

